    {
      "title": "History",
      "items": [],
      "parts": [
        {
          "title": [
            {
              "text": "Under Gavilar",
              "revealedIn": [{ "book": "oathbringer", "chapter": "40" }]
            }
          ],
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Gavilar Kholin and Amaram led the group, working to bring about the Desolations.",
              "revealedIn": [{ "book": "oathbringer", "chapter": "40" }]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": [
            {
              "text": "Under Amaram",
              "revealedIn": [
                { "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "64" },
                { "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "88" },
                { "book": "oathbringer", "chapter": "27" },
                { "book": "oathbringer", "chapter": "120" }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Amaram sees the madman who calls himself Taln and says his and Gavilar's plan has succeeded.",
              "revealedIn": [{ "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "64" }]
            },
            {
              "text": "After the new storm arrives, Amaram writes to Restares that the group has reached its goal.",
              "revealedIn": [{ "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "88" }]
            },
            {
              "text": "Ialai makes Amaram highprince of House Sadeas.",
              "revealedIn": [{ "book": "oathbringer", "chapter": "27" }]
            },
            {
              "text": "At Thaylen City, Amaram sides with Odium and is killed.",
              "revealedIn": [{ "book": "oathbringer", "chapter": "120" }]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": [
            {
              "text": "Fall",
              "revealedIn": [
                { "book": "rhythm-of-war", "chapter": "7" },
                { "book": "rhythm-of-war", "chapter": "13" }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Ialai says the Ghostbloods have killed Thanadal and Vamah, and that Restares is next.",
              "revealedIn": [{ "book": "rhythm-of-war", "chapter": "7" }]
            },
            {
              "text": "Shallan, as Veil, joins the group to reach Ialai, who is poisoned during their meeting.",
              "revealedIn": [{ "book": "rhythm-of-war", "chapter": "7" }]
            },
            {
              "text": "Mraize credits Veil with taking down the Sons of Honor and sends Shallan to find Restares.",
              "revealedIn": [{ "book": "rhythm-of-war", "chapter": "13" }]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Relationships",
      "items": [],
